<h2 id="cancellations-and-refunds">Cancellations, rescheduling, and refunds</h2>
<p>Please contact us as soon as possible if you need to cancel or reschedule. Unless a different policy was clearly disclosed and accepted before booking, payments for services not performed will be refunded, less any work already completed and costs you specifically authorized in advance. We will explain and itemize any amount retained. We do not impose an undisclosed cancellation fee.</p>
<p>If we cannot perform your service, you may choose an available replacement appointment or a refund for the portion not performed. Unsafe weather, inaccessible equipment, missing utilities, or other conditions may require us to pause or reschedule work. Any proposed additional visit charge will be discussed and approved before the visit.</p>
<p>If you have a concern about completed work, contact us with the details so we can review it and discuss an appropriate resolution. These terms do not limit refund or other rights provided by applicable law. Approved refunds are issued to the original payment method when possible; the time to appear in your account depends on your bank or payment provider.</p>
